			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Normalize ESBuild constants and regenerate bridge shapes\n\nRefactor the ESBuild configuration pipeline to align with the project's strict single-line formatting standards. Update `Configuration/ESBuild` modules to replace inline environment checks with centralized imports from `EnvironmentConstant` and standardize `BaseConfig`, `CompileConfig`, and `TargetConfig` to use compact, dense syntax.\n\nSimultaneously, regenerate all 16 `*BridgeShapeGenerated.ts` files in `Source/Effect/*/Implementation` and update the `CommandCatalog` and `ServiceCatalog` versions to \"2026-05-04\". Consolidate verbose multi-line `Pick<>` type declarations into single-line formats to match the high-density code style applied to the build configuration.\n\nThis ensures the build artifacts and generated TypeScript bridge contracts remain synchronized with the latest upstream service interfaces and the project's formatting conventions.",
