				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1914,
				26
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Normalize ESBuild configuration structure and regenerate bridge shapes\n\nRestructure the ESBuild configuration pipeline by migrating from inline definitions to a modular `Configuration/ESBuild` directory. Split shared logic into dedicated `BaseConfig`, `TargetConfig`, `CompileConfig`, and constant files (`EnvironmentConstant`, `BoundConstant`, `PathConstant`) to enforce separation of concerns. Updated `Source/ESBuild.js` to align with the new import paths and standardized environment variable access patterns.\n\nSimultaneously, regenerated all 16 workbench bridge shape definitions in `Source/Effect/*/Implementation/*BridgeShapeGenerated.ts`. Consolidated multi-line `Pick<>` type declarations into single-line formats to improve code density and consistency following the latest codegen pipeline execution.\n\nThis refactoring simplifies build configuration maintenance and ensures the TypeScript bridge contracts remain synchronized with the updated upstream service interfaces.",
			"SHA": "20887658ee6fd8aba79a9e7995f39f05969500bb"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-03T09:32:54Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1914,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Wind): Resolve macOS APFS path mismatch in configuration resolution\n\nOn macOS APFS, the workspace folder URI often carries a trailing slash while file URIs do not. This discrepancy causes `IUriIdentityService.extUri.relativePath` and `ILabelService.getUriLabel` to fail path computation, resulting in breadcrumbs rendering absolute paths (e.g., `/Volumes/<vol>/...`) instead of relative ones.\n\nUpdate `ResolveConfiguration` to strip a single trailing slash from the resolved workspace folder URI. This ensures the workspace root aligns with the workbench's file URI normalization strategy, restoring correct relative path display in the breadcrumb and label services.\n\nThis aligns the configuration logic with the Tauri IPC substrate's path handling requirements established in the recent migration.",
			"SHA": "c3d61a6b873e54376b98cced962903c53ca200af"
		}
	],
